WEBVTT

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:34.990
<b>The 3 From the Training Institute {M: The first two characters mean curriculum/course, and the 3rd means place... this isn't a word in Jp apparently? Feel free to reword...}</b>

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:44.290
Um... This is the place for the 
beginners' training, right?

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:52.510
I'm a newbie here to take the course. 
My name's Riku Suigin.

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:56.180
Um... Are you guys trainees, too?

00:01:56.910 --> 00:02:00.730
I look forward to working with 
you guys since we're all new.

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:07.070
Hey, you're...

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:12.280
You're Suigin. You're Riku Suigin-kun, right?

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:16.460
You're the super poor student that 
does nothing but work, right?

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:16.950
Huh?

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:21.110
Wow! I never thought I'd 
meet you in <i>Grave Buster</i>!

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:23.110
Huh? Uh...

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:25.710
I'm sorry... Who are you?

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:28.350
Oh, come on! It's me!

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:31.100
I'm Shaa. We're in the same class together.

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:33.420
Though you were usually sleeping in class,

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.720
so I guess I'm not surprised 
you didn't know.

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:41.470
You didn't actually forget me, 
the student council president, did you?

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:43.030
Oh, yes. Of course.

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.060
You're the student council president, Shaa.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:48.860
Hey, stop being so noisy. {M: the romaji is Titaan but that's also how they write "titan" in Japanese, so I'm just going for that}

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:55.110
Oh, sorry. But I mean, we're all beginners,

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:58.590
so I think it'd be beneficial 
if we all got along.

00:02:58.590 --> 00:02:59.660
That's unnecessary.

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:22.770
Trainee ID: Titan. {M: So there's another character in ep 6 named Ringu which we went with Ling... Not sure if this person's name is supposed to be spelled Rin/Lyn/Lynn/Rin/Rinn...}{M: Hi, I've reached almost the end of part B now and this is actually Farin in disguise... so I went with Rin... I had her name as Lin and did a replace all to Rin so I'm hoping that didn't screw anything else up <<;}

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.340
ID: Shaa.

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:25.230
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:27.060
ID: Riku Suigin.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.650
Oh, hello.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:31.990
I am in charge of this beginner's course.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.030
I'm your instructor, Rin.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:44.120
Your lesson will be held 
here with actual battles.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.090
These are the remains of a 
tomb that's been robbed.

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:48.530
Hundreds of years ago,

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:52.670
grave robbers defeated the boss here 
and looted everything that was here.

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:56.630
Basically a place where soldiers 
once dreamed a dream.

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:03.060
Ma'am, what are those?

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:07.350
Tunnel apes. That's what 
they call those monsters.

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:12.110
Despite the way they look, they're quite 
fast, and they're troublesome.

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:14.310
So we just have to defeat them?

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.600
Basically, yes.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:19.070
Well, let's all work together 
and do our best. Okay?

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:22.450
Let's stop talking and do this thing.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:26.660
Haven't you noticed? 
You started a long time ago.

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:43.230
Everyone who enrolls in <i>Grave Buster</i>

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:46.670
is given an item unique to 
them called a Buster Item.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:49.730
That is your weapon.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:51.900
Mine is Storm Eye!

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.070
Metal Fist.

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:56.000
Whoa, those are awesome.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.990
What's your Buster Item 
look like, Suigin-kun?

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:03.740
Um, well... I have one, but...

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:04.660
Here they come!

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:13.100
<i>As I thought, my sword can't pierce them. {M: could be swords in general}</i>

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:16.090
What are we supposed to do if 
physical attacks don't work?

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.850
Yeah, that did zero damage.

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:27.600
Their armor is as hard as minerals.{Z: um... which minerals?}

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:30.030
First, we need to defeat their elder.

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:31.080
Elder?

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:33.520
The big one with the three eyes.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.940
That's their elder, the Grand Tunnel Ape. {M: <_<}

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:40.850
Its power is keeping the other 
tunnel apes' armor hard.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:44.590
Seriously? We have to beat that thing?

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:55.790
Amazing!

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:24.980
Wow...

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:29.440
That move... I'm pretty 
sure I've seen it before.

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:36.790
Our plans got a little messed up, 
but small fry still produce coins!

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:40.420
I'm gonna cut through all these 
tunnel apes with a triple combo!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.210
And level up!

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:51.400
S-So beautiful. An idol you'd 
only see once every millennium.

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:54.100
Instructor, no, Princess Rinko.

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:57.790
I am your humble servant!

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:00.530
I will serve you as long as I live!

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:05.700
My pulse has gone beyond its limit! 
This is so much fun!

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:07.070
Sun.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:08.330
Here.

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:09.780
Shaa.

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:13.410
Is Shaa absent today?

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.390
Come to think of it...

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:16.800
I haven't seen him today.

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:19.000
I didn't even notice.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.920
He doesn't really stand out.

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:31.810
That was quite the haul.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:35.560
I guess that ends the beginner's course.

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:37.520
What? No way!

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:41.780
Princess Rinko, please order 
me around some more!

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:48.950
Well, you see, in order to actually 
pass this beginner's course...

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:53.250
you must defeat me,

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.660
with your team of three!

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.490
Seaweed! {M: I... I have no idea what else this could be }

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.800
I was able to basically see

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:12.140
the extent of your abilities 
from your reactions just now.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:13.850
ID: Titan.

00:08:13.850 --> 00:08:18.190
You were able to summon a familiar 
without using your Buster Item.

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:20.060
I'm assuming you were being careful,

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:23.650
thinking that my kunai might've 
had some additional effect.

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:27.320
However, that was just a physical attack. {lit: Unfortunately,}

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.070
A familiar?

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:34.910
Titan-kun, how much money 
did you put into this game?

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:37.940
I put about 500,000 of my 
allowance into it myself,

00:08:37.940 --> 00:08:40.080
but there's no way I 
could afford a familiar!

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:45.760
I guess that means you defeated some 
high-level monsters and saved up some coins.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:47.810
Oh, yeah. Suigin-kun,

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:49.260
I don't think you've put 
anything into this game

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:50.960
since you're working all the time...

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:51.600
Huh?

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:56.160
My family's super rich, so I'll put even 
more money into the game and protect you.

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:58.810
Let's all get through this 
beginner's course together!

00:08:58.810 --> 00:08:59.940
Shut up!

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:01.350
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:05.230
ID: Shaa, first of all, 
remove that kunai out of your head.

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:06.910
Kunai?

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:09.350
Huh? Where?

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:15.410
There's a kunai! Sticking out of my head!

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:17.070
Bi zui! {orig: Shut up!} {M: She says shut up in Chinese I think?}{z: pretty sure this it sans the accent marks since they don't work right with this font and renderer-san}

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:20.040
Stop screaming and quickly remove 
that thing from your head!

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:23.450
Remove it? But that sounds like it'd hurt!

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:24.250
Hurry up!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.550
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:28.110
I'm squirting blood...

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.500
Shaa!

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.070
There's no need to worry.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:36.850
Look at his wound. It's no big deal.

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:43.190
ID: Riku Suigin, if you underestimate 
me, you're going to get hurt.

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:46.320
Wait, I'm not underestimating you.

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:58.120
Your item... is rather unique. {M: It's tougu, literally thief item :/}

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:03.330
<i>Apparently she has the ability 
to see others' equipment.</i>

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.840
Riku Suigin, let me see your Buster Item.

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:11.800
Really, mine's not a big deal.

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:14.190
Who are you?

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.470
That's a rather sudden greeting.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:21.310
Well, I don't like wasting time.

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:30.990
In order to pass this course, 
we need to defeat you.

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:33.570
That was the requirement, 
wasn't it, Instructor Rin?

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:36.050
Yes, you're exactly right.

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:39.710
Fine. Let's continue with the lesson.

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:41.290
This is a very difficult course.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:44.610
Oh, I'm sorry. I lost my textbook.

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:45.980
That won't be a problem, will it?

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:50.010
Actually, it is. I'd rather 
not work overtime for free.

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:54.630
I've definitely seen those moves before.

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.390
I remember now!

00:10:57.390 --> 00:11:00.020
That guy entered the world's three biggest 
virtual fighting game tournaments

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:05.060
for the first time and won all three and 
has held his titles for three years!

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.360
He's the legendary Titan!

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:09.540
Virtual fighting game?

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.320
Yeah.

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:14.880
He crushed all of his opponents with his 
incredible power, speed, and technique!

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:18.160
He's the undefeated Crusher Titan!

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:21.750
But for some reason he didn't 
enter any tournament this year,

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:23.830
and no matter how much you search for him

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:26.470
on the Internet, all of his 
information's been deleted.

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:34.970
<b>Rin's True Identity</b>

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:40.430
The amazing Titan!

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:45.020
No one else has ever been able to win this 
title three times in a row undefeated.

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:48.230
He is truly the world's strongest!

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:54.570
Young Master, your father has 
sent you a congratulatory gift.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:57.230
Please accept it.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:02.120
Dad, what is this?

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:05.500
<i>Grave Buster</i>. This will be your new goal.

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:07.480
That wasn't our deal!

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:10.840
You need to show immediate results. Understood?

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:15.950
Yes, sir.

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:20.980
Why don't you guys help out?

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:23.810
Don't you want to hurry up and 
put an end to this farce?

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:27.310
We can't get to the next 
stage unless we defeat her!

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:28.630
Don't underestimate me!

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:33.400
Even if there were ten of you, 
I could beat you all while napping!

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:41.190
I've finally met her! My goddess!

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:44.200
And I'm supposed to defeat her?

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:47.910
Screw this reality! Why is fate so cruel?

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:52.320
But I'm going steel myself and 
defeat you! No, wait, I can't...

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:56.920
But this victory will be the proof 
of how much I love Princess Rinko!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:02.050
I will fight for you! Let's go see 
the Terracotta Army together!

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:03.940
T-Terracotta Army?

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:06.270
Let's go, Suigin-kun!

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:09.560
To the battlefield where 
I will profess my love!

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:12.560
Princess Rinko!

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:14.800
Raven Scarf: activate! {M: ... Could be Reibun but I have no idea at this point?}

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:36.210
Item number 01: First Blood engage! {M: what is going on?}

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:42.040
Actually, this was a skill 
where you learn the ability

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:44.640
of the enemy that falls first, wasn't it?

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:50.060
No one's been defeated yet, so I don't 
think it's going to be very useful here...

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:52.020
Suigin-kun!

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:57.030
Look, look! 
This is Storm Eye's special skill!

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:59.030
This is the power of love!

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:00.810
He disappeared?

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:04.200
Over here! I'm right over here, Suigin-kun!

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:06.580
Huh? You're right there?

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:09.750
Yeah! I've now become one with the wind!

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:12.850
My special ability is to 
become one with the wind.

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:16.980
Now I can get close to Princess 
Rinko without her noticing.

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:19.930
Then I'm going to tell 
her my e-mail address!

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:23.240
May my feelings reach you!

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.920
Shaa is taking flight! {M: This might be a horrible attempt of referencing gundam and char...}

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:28.260
Uh, we can tell where you 
are if you're talking.

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.710
Begone from my sight!

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:33.400
Crap!

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:40.160
Seaweed, how much HP does she have left?

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:43.700
Beginning analysis.

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:47.260
Remaining HP is about 15 percent.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:48.430
More specifically—

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:53.500
It's a crime to film a lady without 
their permission, you know.

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:56.170
I'm sorry, did you say something?

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:58.670
What a shame. You're so strong...

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:04.130
Unfortunately, I can't let you 
pass the beginner's course.

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:11.430
<i>Princess Rinko, accept my e-mail address!</i>

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:19.750
You fool.

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.200
Shaa!

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:29.330
Sorry, Suigin-kun.

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:35.710
I guess someone with no talent like me isn't meant to play <i>Grave Buster</i>.

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:39.170
That's not true! You can get stronger!

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:44.990
Do you honestly think I could 
become like you or Titan-kun?

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:46.840
Of course you can, Shaa!

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:49.950
Thanks, Suigin-kun.

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:55.140
When I become stronger, I'll become 
LINE friends with Princess Rinko.

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:56.880
Suigin-kun...

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:57.600
What is it?

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:04.490
I would've preferred using Princess 
Rin's lap as a pillow, in the end...

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:12.320
I see, I finally understand.

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:14.850
This fight is pointless.

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:15.460
What?

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:18.420
Titan, you won't be able to defeat her.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:19.500
What?

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:22.480
Instructor Rin... is invincible.

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:25.670
How are you feeling, Shaa?

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:29.360
I'll leave your dinner and some 
cold medicine by the door.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:30.760
Make sure you eat it.

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:32.770
Mom! Listen to this!

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:34.950
I made a friend!

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:38.490
What are you talking about? 
Did your cold get worse?

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:43.520
No! I actually made a friend!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:47.220
He's poor, unlike me, 
so he works all the time,

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:51.410
but he's my classmate who's always 
sleeping, and really good at games...

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:54.420
I'm the only one who's invincible 
because I am undefeated!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.750
In this world, there is no one stronger than me.

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:05.340
I definitely can't let you pass!

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:08.880
Shut up. I'm still in the 
middle of my routine.

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:09.920
Let's see...

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:13.690
Given the reach of the signal, I imagine it's around here...

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.560
Oh, that's probably it.

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:22.520
I admit that you're very much qualified,

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:26.990
but there's something terrifying 
hiding within your heart.

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:31.700
And I have a feeling if we let you loose 
as you are, something awful will happen.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:35.720
So I can't let you pass 
the beginner's course...

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:37.120
You must be Instructor Rin.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:42.800
This means I pass the 
beginner's course, right?

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:45.420
Riku Suigin! How did you figure it out?

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:49.590
Back there your shadow clone was able 
to precisely stab Shaa in his heart,

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:53.250
even though he wasn't in her field of view.

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:56.960
He wouldn't have been visible unless 
you were looking from another angle.

00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:59.700
Which meant the real you wasn't there.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:02.060
That's enough! I got it already!

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:03.810
Wh-What?!

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:05.630
That was a decoy?

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:08.990
I was fighting with this... thing?

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:10.490
Impossible!

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:13.610
I'm Titan! The thrice undefeated 
virtual fighting champion!

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:16.410
I was being played by this fake?

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:23.230
Prove to me that you are the best.

00:18:23.230 --> 00:18:25.380
Do not disappoint me.

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:29.550
Begone!

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.430
Decoy Mirage.

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:38.140
It has the ability to copy the 
appearance of its player.

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:42.350
You completely had me fooled 
with your familiar.

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:47.690
To think the true identity of 
the instructor was this child.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.280
<i>Beginner's course completed.</i>

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:55.380
<i>Welcome to the world of </i>Grave Buster<i>.</i>

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:59.620
<i>Those who pass the beginner's 
course may use the ally card.</i>

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:02.750
What's the ally card?

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:05.950
You can have your Seabays read each other's

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:09.400
card info and form parties based on said data.

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:12.440
Meaning you can make teams.

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:13.590
Hang on a minute.

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:16.580
Tell me who you really are already.

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:22.310
I have a hard time believing 
that you're a beginner.

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:25.230
Maybe when the time is right.

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:28.360
I'd like to know, too...

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:31.140
Just how strong you are!

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:36.160
Stop! The course is over!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.450
It's not over...

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.790
Not until I crush my opponent!

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:50.290
This is exactly why I didn't 
want to let him pass!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:51.750
Stop it, Titan!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:57.970
I'm meant to defeat 
everything in this world.

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.790
That includes you, Riku Suigin!

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:04.920
Let's go!

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:06.390
He's touched in the head!

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:20.590
I guess we can buy some time here.

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:22.100
Riku Suigin.

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:24.200
Did you not take any damage?

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.440
I'm perfectly fine,

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:28.150
Instructor Rin.

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:29.430
You can call me Farin.

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:31.920
Huh? Farin, why aren't you attacking?

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:37.620
After dispelling my Decoy Mirage, 
I'm not able to do anything for a while.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:41.180
Why did you save me?

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:43.390
Because I want to create a party with this.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:47.230
You're asking me out on a date? 
You're not my type.

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:52.190
<i>Master!</i>

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:56.230
Hey, uh... What the heck do you want?

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.150
<i>You should withdraw already.</i>

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:01.160
<i>If you've passed the beginner's 
course, you should be done there.</i>

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:03.620
Like I could just walk 
away from this situation.

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:07.200
<i>You're such a softy when it comes to girls!</i>

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:11.960
Why don't we make a bet, Farin?

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:16.190
If I'm able to defeat Titan, who's waiting 
outside, I'd like you to join my team.

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:18.630
You pervert.

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:22.310
Let's pinky swear. It's a promise.

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:28.820
Found you!

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:33.940
<b>Next Time
Titan Goes Berserk / A Bewildered Suigin</b>

00:23:30.310 --> 00:23:31.780
The Silver Guardian!
